{"nodes": [{"id": "backend_php_readme_backend_php_kinghost", "label": "Backend PHP na KingHost", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reimplementa o mesmo papel do backend Node em PHP puro porque a hospedagem compartilhada da KingHost roda PHP nativamente, sem instalar nada. O Node continua sendo o ambiente de desenvolvimento local (XAMPP); a pasta PHP existe s\u00f3 para a hospedagem."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_banco_mysql_kinghost", "label": "Banco MySQL da hospedagem (KingHost)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nome do banco \u00e9 imposto pela KingHost (ex.: coracao1_bd1) e o acesso externo por IP fica desligado porque o PHP roda no mesmo servidor \u2014 menos superf\u00edcie de ataque. As tabelas s\u00e3o criadas sozinhas no primeiro acesso para evitar importar dump \u00e0 m\u00e3o."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_config_php", "label": "api/config.php (credenciais centralizadas)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00danico ponto de configura\u00e7\u00e3o: DB_NAME/DB_USER/DB_PASS/DB_HOST, SICREDI_*, CORREIOS_*, SMTP_* e VAPID_CHAVE_PRIVADA_PEM. DB_HOST normalmente n\u00e3o \u00e9 localhost na KingHost, \u00e9 o 'Host para conex\u00e3o' do painel."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_publicacao_frontend", "label": "Publica\u00e7\u00e3o do front (npm run build \u2192 dist \u2192 public_html)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "VITE_BACKEND_URL no .env precisa apontar para o mesmo dom\u00ednio onde a pasta backend-php/api ser\u00e1 servida em /api, sem barra final; o conte\u00fado de dist (index.html + assets) vai para dentro de public_html via FTP."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_pix_sicredi", "label": "PIX Sicredi (backend PHP)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Certificados cert.pem/key.pem ficam em sicredi_certs no diret\u00f3rio home, FORA de public_html, para nunca serem serviveis por HTTP. SICREDI_AMBIENTE alterna homologacao/producao."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_qr_pix_estatico", "label": "QR PIX est\u00e1tico (reserva)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Enquanto o Sicredi n\u00e3o estiver configurado, a loja usa o QR est\u00e1tico com a chave PIX das Configura\u00e7\u00f5es \u2014 a venda nunca para por falta de credencial."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_webhook_pix", "label": "Webhook PIX do Sicredi", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "POST /api/webhook/pix d\u00e1 confirma\u00e7\u00e3o instant\u00e2nea, mas \u00e9 opcional: o site tamb\u00e9m consulta o status da cobran\u00e7a a cada 5 s, ent\u00e3o a confirma\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o depende do webhook chegar."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_correios_rastreamento", "label": "Rastreamento Correios", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Usa c\u00f3digo de acesso do Portal Meu Correios (n\u00e3o a senha) + cart\u00e3o de postagem. Sem credenciais ou antes da postagem a p\u00e1gina mostra s\u00f3 o andamento interno (Processando \u2192 Em tr\u00e2nsito \u2192 Entregue): a integra\u00e7\u00e3o nunca derruba o rastreamento."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_smtp", "label": "Envio de e-mail por SMTP autenticado", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Resolve o problema de e-mail caindo em spam: MAIL_DE tem de ser a mesma caixa autenticada em SMTP_USUARIO porque a maioria dos servidores rejeita remetente diferente do autenticado. Host e porta variam por servidor da KingHost, por isso n\u00e3o h\u00e1 valor fixo documentado."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_mail_nativo", "label": "mail() nativo do PHP (padr\u00e3o)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Funciona sem configurar nada, mas n\u00e3o \u00e9 envio autenticado \u2014 qualquer servidor pode alegar que manda em nome do dom\u00ednio \u2014 ent\u00e3o costuma cair como spam. Fica como caminho padr\u00e3o enquanto os campos SMTP estiverem vazios."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_web_push_vapid", "label": "Notifica\u00e7\u00e3o no celular (Web Push / VAPID)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Par de chaves gerado uma vez com openssl (prime256v1) e guardado em vapid.pem FORA de public_html; a chave p\u00fablica \u00e9 derivada do arquivo, n\u00e3o existe chave para colar no site. Sem o arquivo o bot\u00e3o de notifica\u00e7\u00f5es nem aparece. Exige HTTPS (garantido pelo .htaccess). No iOS 16.4+ o cliente precisa adicionar o site \u00e0 tela inicial antes \u2014 exig\u00eancia da Apple."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_rotas_api", "label": "Rotas da API PHP (/api)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Superf\u00edcie HTTP espelhada 1:1 com o backend Node (dados, avaliacoes, pix, pedidos, push, webhook, recrutamentos, equipe) para que o mesmo front sirva os dois ambientes sem ramifica\u00e7\u00e3o de c\u00f3digo."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_colecoes_dados", "label": "Cole\u00e7\u00f5es de dados (GET/PUT /api/dados)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cole\u00e7\u00f5es gravadas em bloco: produtos, pedidos, clientes, cargos, recrutamentos, cupons, alertasEstoque, banners e config."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_avaliacoes", "label": "Avalia\u00e7\u00f5es de produto (coment\u00e1rio + v\u00eddeo)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "S\u00f3 quem comprou o produto cria/atualiza avalia\u00e7\u00e3o; o Admin pode listar todas (?todas=1) e excluir avalia\u00e7\u00e3o impr\u00f3pria \u2014 modera\u00e7\u00e3o depois da publica\u00e7\u00e3o, n\u00e3o antes."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_recrutamentos", "label": "Recrutamento de vendedores por c\u00f3digo", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Master/MasterPlus cadastra vendedor na pr\u00f3pria equipe: quem j\u00e1 tem conta entra ativado com o cargo dado; quem n\u00e3o tem recebe um c\u00f3digo para ativar no pr\u00f3prio perfil."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_cargos_equipe", "label": "Cargos da equipe (vendedor / master)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "POST /api/equipe/cargo d\u00e1 (vendedor), promove (master) ou tira (null) o cargo, restrito \u00e0 pr\u00f3pria equipe do Master/MasterPlus."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_https_ssl", "label": "HTTPS obrigat\u00f3rio (SSL Let's Encrypt)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Certificado gr\u00e1tis do painel s\u00f3 funciona depois do DNS apontado para a KingHost. Site, PIX e Web Push exigem HTTPS; o .htaccess for\u00e7a a redire\u00e7\u00e3o."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_seguranca", "label": "Seguran\u00e7a dos segredos no servidor", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Defesa em camadas: o servidor executa o PHP em vez de mostrar o fonte, o .htaccess ainda bloqueia acesso direto a config.php e lib.php, e certificados/vapid ficam fora de public_html."}, {"id": "backend_php_readme_degradacao_graciosa", "label": "Degrada\u00e7\u00e3o graciosa por configura\u00e7\u00e3o ausente", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Princ\u00edpio repetido em todas as integra\u00e7\u00f5es: sem credencial o recurso cai para um modo simples em vez de quebrar \u2014 QR PIX est\u00e1tico sem Sicredi, mail() sem SMTP, rastreio interno sem Correios, bot\u00e3o de notifica\u00e7\u00e3o escondido sem vapid.pem. 'Nada quebra por falta de configura\u00e7\u00e3o.'"}], "edges": [{"source": "backend_php_readme_backend_php_kinghost", "target": "backend_php_readme_banco_mysql_kinghost", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_config_php", "target": "backend_php_readme_banco_mysql_kinghost", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_config_php", "target": "backend_php_readme_pix_sicredi", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_config_php", "target": "backend_php_readme_correios_rastreamento", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_config_php", "target": "backend_php_readme_smtp", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_config_php", "target": "backend_php_readme_web_push_vapid", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_pix_sicredi", "target": "backend_php_readme_webhook_pix", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_qr_pix_estatico", "target": "backend_php_readme_pix_sicredi", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_mail_nativo", "target": "backend_php_readme_smtp", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_web_push_vapid", "target": "backend_php_readme_https_ssl", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_web_push_vapid", "target": "backend_php_readme_smtp", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_seguranca", "target": "backend_php_readme_config_php", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_seguranca", "target": "backend_php_readme_pix_sicredi", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_rotas_api", "target": "backend_php_readme_colecoes_dados", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_rotas_api", "target": "backend_php_readme_avaliacoes", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_rotas_api", "target": "backend_php_readme_recrutamentos", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "backend_php_readme_rotas_api", "target": "backend_php_readme_correios_rastreamento", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "backend-php/REA